        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vilayat Khan, Ravi Shankar, Ali Akbar Khan, Nikhil Banerjee, Imrat Khan, Enayat Khan, Baba Allauddin Khan\n- Topics: Indian Classical Music, sitar, introducing music to the West\n\nFacts:\n- Enayat Khan was the father of Vilayat Khan.\n- Vilayat Khan became one of the topmost sitar players of the postwar period.\n- Nikhil Banerjee was a student of Baba Allauddin Khan.\n- Nikhil Banerjee was known for technical virtuosity and clinical execution.\n- Vilayat Khan, Ravi Shankar, Ali Akbar Khan, Nikhil Banerjee, and Imrat Khan helped introduce Indian Classical Music to the West.",
